From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alfred Ben <e0958604@u.nus.edu>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:24:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] update: make the background auto-update opt-in with
 CODEDB_AUTO_UPDATE=1

The auto-update pipes the public install.sh into bash, which installs the
upstream release over whatever binary runs, including a fork build.
It now runs only when CODEDB_AUTO_UPDATE=1; CODEDB_NO_AUTO_UPDATE still
turns it off. Without opt-in, codedb mcp touches no stamp file. The
manual codedb update command is unchanged.
